Rips_UpdateStake
├── when the caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert.
├── when the stake does not exist
│   └── it should revert.
├── when ticket cap is not a power of two
│   └── it should revert.
├── when prize distribution is empty
│   └── it should revert.
├── when a tier has min prize greater than max prize
│   └── it should revert.
├── when total prize count does not equal ticket cap
│   └── it should revert.
├── when total prize pool does not equal ticket cap times ticket cost
│   └── it should revert.
├── when fee percent exceeds 10000
│   └── it should revert.
├── when the config is valid
│   ├── it should store the config as pending.
│   └── it should emit a {StakeUpdated} event.
└── when the next round is created after an update
    ├── it should apply the pending config to the active stake.
    └── it should clear the pending config.
